* `Hc x - x Gc x = 1` and `x Hc x = -log (1 - x)` on `UG`;
* `Ubar`, `Zbar` are the averaged-logarithm profiles with `Ubar 0 = -7/72`, `Zbar 0 = -7/144`;
* `q3_j = j³ Q3`, `r3_j = j³ R3` are C¹ on `UG` with the task-book source bounds.
